[00:00.14]It’s so cold…
{"刺骨寒冷…"}
[00:04.65]I need that Peach, I need that juice…
{"我渴求那蟠桃　渴求那琼浆…"}
[00:11.16]But they just give me iron, liquid copper…
{"他们却只给我铁汁铜浆…"}
[00:32.96]I wake up in the morning, got a mountain on my spine
{"晨起时整座山压在我脊梁"}
[00:35.51]Yellow paper on the rock, keeping me confined
{"黄符镇在石上　将我永禁锢"}
[00:38.00]Five hundred winters, I been waiting for a sign
{"五百个寒冬　我在等待征兆"}
[00:40.31]I got peaches in my dreams, but I got murder on my mind
{"梦中蟠桃满枝　心头杀意翻涌"}
[00:43.24]Yeah, I got murder on my mind
{"是啊　我心头杀意翻涌"}
[00:45.07]I got vengeance on my mind
{"我心头复仇之火燃烧"}
[00:47.34]I got iron in my stomach, copper juice is like my wine
{"铁汁在腹中翻腾　铜浆是我的酒"}
[00:50.20]I wake up in the morning, got a mountain on my spine
{"晨起时整座山压在我脊梁"}
[00:54.93]The moss is growing on my ears, I cannot turn my head
{"苔藓爬满双耳　我无法转头"}
[00:57.82]I heard a shepherd boy pass by, I asked him for some bread
{"听见牧童经过　向他讨块面饼"}
[01:00.55]He looked at me like I’m a ghost, I wished that I was dead
{"他见鬼般瞪着我　我宁愿已死去"}
[01:04.11]I used to sleep on tiger skins, now stones are in my bed
{"曾卧虎皮安眠　如今石床为伴"}
[01:06.61]I didn't mean to crash the party, didn't mean to sin
{"本无意搅乱盛宴　本无心犯戒"}
[01:09.21]I just wanted a seat at the table, let the monkey in
{"只求在宴席间　给猴儿留个座"}
[01:11.82]But Jade Emperor pressed a button, called the army in
{"玉帝却按下机关　天兵蜂拥而至"}
[01:14.37]Now I’m stuck inside this hole, I don't know where to begin
{"如今困在这洞中　不知从何开始"}
[01:17.22]My armor rusted in the dirt, my cudgel in my ear
{"铠甲在土里锈蚀　金箍棒藏耳中"}
[01:19.95]I haven't seen a female monkey in five hundred years
{"五百年来未见　一只母猴踪影"}
[01:22.91]I cry these lava tears, but nobody sees 'em fall
{"熔岩泪滴坠落　却无人看见"}
[01:25.69]I’m talking to the ants, 'cause I got no one else to call
{"只能对蚂蚁倾诉　再无可唤之人"}
[01:28.71]I wake up in the morning, got a mountain on my spine
{"晨起时整座山压在我脊梁"}
[01:31.27]Yellow paper on the rock, keeping me confined
{"黄符镇在石上　将我永禁锢"}
[01:33.76]Five hundred winters, I been waiting for a sign
{"五百个寒冬　我一直在等待征兆"}
[01:36.13]I got peaches in my dreams, but I got murder on my mind
{"梦中蟠桃鲜甜　心中杀意翻涌"}
[01:40.12]Buddha put his hand down, flipped it to a cage
{"佛陀覆手为牢　翻转囚笼"}
[01:42.58]Thinking 'bout the Heaven Palace, filled me up with rage
{"遥想凌霄宝殿　怒火填满我胸"}
[01:45.09]I see the seasons changing, turning like a page
{"四季更迭如书页翻动"}
[01:47.80]From a King to a prisoner, locked up on the stage
{"从齐天大圣到阶下囚笼"}
[01:50.60]Yellow talisman around my body, it’s a homicide
{"黄符缠身如同致命诅咒"}
[01:54.30]They tried to kill my spirit, keep the beast inside
{"他们想扼杀元神　囚禁凶兽"}
[01:57.16]But if that Monk comes by and cuts the tape aside
{"但若圣僧临世　斩断符咒"}
[01:59.79]I promise on my life, everybody gonna slide
{"我以性命起誓　众生皆要俯首"}
[02:02.89]I wait for the footsteps
{"我等待脚步声声"}
[02:05.26]Is that Guan Yin, or is that a trap
{"是观音降临　还是陷阱重重"}
[02:07.32]I’m losing my mind, I’m taking a nap
{"神识逐渐涣散　陷入昏沉梦中"}
[02:09.40]Five hundred winters, just a little gap
{"五百个寒冬　不过弹指一瞬"}
[02:13.42]I wake up in the morning, got a mountain on my spine
{"晨醒时五行山压脊如弓"}
[02:15.83]Yellow paper on the rock, keeping me confined
{"山石黄纸　困我形神其中"}
[02:18.51]Five hundred winters, I been waiting for a sign
{"五百个寒冬　我一直在等待征兆"}
[02:20.74]I got peaches in my dreams, but I got murder on my mind
{"梦中蟠桃鲜甜　心中杀意翻涌"}
[02:25.23]It’s so cold…
{"好冷啊……"}
[02:29.54]I need that Peach, I need that juice…
{"我渴求那仙桃　渴求那琼浆"}
[02:36.65]But they just give me iron, liquid copper…
{"他们却只给我　铁汁铜浆"}
